<title>NEW ZEALAND: EMCO releases average NZ Oct electricity prices.</title>
<headline>EMCO releases average NZ Oct electricity prices.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electricity market operator EMCO said on Tuesday the average New Zealand electricity price in October for the North Island was NZ$43.91 per megawatt hour.</p>
<p>For the South Island it was NZ$32.10 per megawatt hour.</p>
</text>
